{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0Rob29tJTIwRGFkYWtrYSUyMCUyODIwMDglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Dhoom Dadakka","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qMOUAFO8oyZ48F9411cdGg526jE.jpg","description":"At a Bangkok 'Asian Bhai Meet' the Godfather meets with several gangsters, reviews the reduction in revenue, and decides to induct fresh blood. While Fursat Lala decides to hand-over this task to his son, Zac; Mungi Lal, a bachelor, has no heir, save for an long-estranged maternal nephew, Kamal, and is asked to find him and include him in this gang within 30 days. Mungi and his associate, Jignesh, head out to Mumbai in an effort to locate his estranged sister, Angoori, and her son - in vain - as there is no trace of the duo. He recruits the services of Private Detective Johnny English and instructs him to locate Kamal. Johnny does locate him and takes him to meet with Mungi - a move that will result in nothing but hilarious chaos when Mungi tells him that he has already located Kamal. Things get even more confusing after a woman shows up - also claiming to be Kamal!!\n\nReleased 23 May 2008 · India · Language: Hindi · 128 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2008","genres":["Drama","Comedy","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"8.7","runtime":"128 min","cast":["Jackie Shroff","Anupam Kher","Satish Shah","Gulshan Grover","Satish Kaushik","Sammir Dattani","Aarti Chabria","Shama Sikander"],"director":["Shashi Ranjan"],"released":"2008-05-23T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"A gangster is asked to come up with a heir within 30 days","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Shashi Ranjan","character":"Director"},{"name":"Jackie Shroff","character":"Godfather","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sVqe6VioM37LQwgQLd8wnC5vapK.jpg"},{"name":"Anupam Kher","character":"Mungi Lal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kgU5Ap1Kf9RnicB5DMcXEZqed2f.jpg"},{"name":"Satish Shah","character":"Jignesh","photo":"http